<title>POLAND: Animex plans new share issue.</title>
<headline>Animex plans new share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader and producer Animex SA plans a new share issue to finance its 1997-2000 investment programme, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Animex said the plan envisaged investment in Polish food producers but did not say whether it would buy new firms or modernise and expand its current subsidiaries.</p>
<p>The statement gave no other details on the issue.</p>
<p>Animex said the issue would be voted on at a shareholders meeting but did not say when it would take place.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
